                                "sense_id": "7952580f-83be-37ae-9335-b79a6bd47805",
                                "text": "There was yet within him the means of repentance, could a locus penitentiæ^([sic]) have been supplied to him. He grieved bitterly over his own ill doings, and knew well what changes gentlehood would have demanded from him."
                            },
